OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy across the south this evening
OL,7,Fwith some more persistent rain over
OL,8,FDumfries and Galloway and far south
OL,9,FBorders, gradually clearing. Otherwise
OL,10,Fdry with long clear spells developing.
OL,11,FWith light winds, a touch of ground
OL,12,Ffrost is possible.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FA chilly, dry start with
OL,15,Fsunny spells but showers reach
OL,16,FDumfries and Galloway through the
OL,17,Fmorning and Lothian and Borders in the
OL,18,Fafternoon. Winds turning more
OL,19,Fnorthwesterly and freshening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
