OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FBright, chilly start Thursday but
OL,7,Fincreasing cloud brings occasionally
OL,8,Fheavy evening rain. The rain clears
OL,9,Fovernight to leave Friday and Saturday
OL,10,Fwith sunny spells and increasingly
OL,11,Ffrequent heavy, blustery showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
